Property:
	Tag: [Guide, Module]
	Module: Markdown

The **Markdown** module keeps a whole Markdown document in one block: a README, a page copied from elsewhere, or notes that should stay exactly as Markdown. Pasted as ordinary text, the same lines would become many blocks. Back to [[Welcome]].

Markdown:
	### A lab checklist

	Weigh the sample, then titrate **slowly** near the end point.

	- [x] Weigh 0.5 g of KHP
	- [ ] Titrate with NaOH
		- [ ] Note the color change
	- [ ] Work out the molarity

	| Trial | Volume (mL) |
	|:--|--:|
	| 1 | 24.10 |
	| 2 | 24.05 |

	```Python
	molarity = mass / 204.22 / (volume / 1000)
	```

It looks like the rest of the note, and its to-do boxes tick too. A click opens the whole document for editing.
